return {
    ["       萨斯利尔身上的血肉和阴影”斗篷”同时膨胀了起来。砰！洛薇雅崩溃的身体被弹飞了出去，摔在了地上，而那属于她的阴影被直接撕碎，化成一片片虚幻的轻纱缓缓飘落。一道道缭绕着神圣火焰的光芒接连落下，击在了洛薇雅的身上，泯灭着她的灵魂，净化着她的血肉。洛薇雅的气息急速消散，淡灰的眼眸飞快失去了神采。她崩溃成一团血肉的身体蜷缩了起来，用那一条条没有皮肤的，满是鲜红黏液的手臂将那个乳白色的，偏大型的人类头骨紧紧抱”胸前”，压到了身下。炽烈的”阳光”照射中，神圣的火焰燃烧里，洛薇雅保持着这个姿态，不让自己有丝毫的动弹，不让那个人类头骨显露出来，受到伤害。又是一道光柱煊赫击落，洛薇雅的身体忍不住弹了一下，但还是剧烈颤抖着蜷缩于那里。最终，这团扭曲的，恶心的，蠕动的血肉停止了一切活动，死死地覆盖在那个人类头骨表面黯淡无光破败"] = "       The flesh and the shadow \"cloak\" on Sasrir's body expanded simultaneously. Bang! Lovia's collapsing body was sent flying, crashing to the ground. The shadow that belonged to her was torn directly to shreds, turning into fragments of illusory gauze that drifted down slowly. Beams of light wreathed in holy flames descended one after another, striking Lovia's body, annihilating her soul and purifying her flesh. Lovia's aura dissipated rapidly, and her pale gray eyes quickly lost their luster. Her body, which had collapsed into a mass of flesh, curled up, using those skinless arms covered in bright red mucus to tightly hug that milky-white, oversized human skull to her \"chest,\" pressing it beneath her. Amidst the scorching \"sunlight\" and the burning holy flames, Lovia maintained this posture, not allowing herself to move in the slightest, preventing that human skull from being exposed and harmed. Another brilliant pillar of light struck down, and Lovia's body couldn't help but jerk, but she still curled up there, trembling violently. Finally, this twisted, disgusting, writhing mass of flesh ceased all activity, dead and covering the dull, dilapidated surface of that human skull.",
    ["97种谜题，7种未知，有一定危险性，但成功的概率不低。"] = "97 puzzles, 7 unknown, with a certain degree of danger, but the probability of success is not low.",
